    "description": "Perched atop Nob Hill, this elegant home looks out across the city's north side, where the urban landscape gives way to the bay and iconic Golden Gate Bridge. Sunlight fills the space through oversized windows, drawing attention to the beautifully finished hardwood floors, a well-appointed chef's kitchen complete with a breakfast bar, and updated finishes.    The thoughtfully designed kitchen is equipped with everything you need - a gas range with hood, dishwasher, and garbage disposal, making it as functional as it is stylish. A spacious bedroom with a large closet, in-unit laundry, and tasteful finishes throughout add to the home's effortless appeal.    Beyond your own space, the building impresses with a grand entryway and a stunning shared rooftop deck, complete with firepits, a BBQ area, and panoramic city, Golden Gate Bridge, and bay views. Whether you're looking for a chic pied-a-terre or the perfect first home, this is a rare opportunity to own in one of the city's most sought-after neighborhoods. Just steps from world-class dining, shopping, and San Francisco's most iconic landmarks, this is San Francisco living at its finest."
  },
